title":"Overlay ALL detected circles","properties":{"nCircleIndex":-1,"nThickness":3},"extra":{"widget_data":{}}},{"id":"74e492bb-b776-4e07-bfdd-25307aa0817d","type":"Vision/Basic Image Operations/F_VN_CopyImage","pos":[533.284912109375,827.4856567382812],"size":[190.85800170898438,60],"flags":{},"order":8,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"name":"onTrigger","type":-1,"link":null},{"name":"ipSrcImage","type":"INTERFACE (ITcVnImage)","link":7},{"name":"hrPrev","type":"ALIAS (HRESULT),DINT","link":null}],"outputs":[{"name":"onExecuted","type":-1,"links":[]},{"name":"ipDestImage","type":"INTERFACE (ITcVnImage)","links":[8]},{"name":"hresult","type":"ALIAS (HRESULT),DINT","links":[]}],"title":"Copy original for overlay","properties":{}},{"id":"d6a6a786-b19f-488b-8315-1d51e4910936","type":"Display/ITcVnImage","pos":[2224.67529296875,783.7796630859375],"size":[800,678],"flags":{},"order":11,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"name":"onTrigger","type":-1,"link":null},{"name":"in","type":"INTERFACE (ITcVnImage)","link":12}],"outputs":[{"name":"onExecuted","type":-1,"links":[]}],"title":"Detected circles on original","properties":{},"extra":{"widget_data":{"display":{"annotations":[]}}}},{"id":"e3d9a8cf-442f-45bb-8902-2c7ea7e43213","type":"Display/DINT","pos":[3043.076171875,1557.2760009765625],"size":[210,60],"flags":{},"order":7,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"name":"onTrigger","type":-1,"link":null},{"name":"in","type":"DINT","link":16}],"outputs":[{"name":"onExecuted","type":-1,"links":[]}],"title":"Detected doughnut count","properties":{},"extra":{"widget_data":{}}},{"id":"aebbb247-1956-4d4a-9035-05006d1f42eb","type":"Display/ITcVnImage","pos":[1325.1126708984375,321.20965576171875],"size":[350.47705078125,289.3214416503906],"flags":{},"order":3,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"name":"onTrigger","type":-1,"link":null},{"name":"in","type":"INTERFACE (ITcVnImage)","link":4}],"outputs":[{"name":"onExecuted","type":-1,"links":[]}],"title":"Processed grayscale image","properties":{},"extra":{"widget_data":{"display":{"annotations":[]}}}}],"links":[[1,"9f1c71d4-42bb-47c9-ad0d-46212dd6f65c",1,"fe03c3ef-d5f3-42fc-92be-e49da2a66061",1,"INTERFACE (ITcVnImage)"],[2,"fe03c3ef-d5f3-42fc-92be-e49da2a66061",1,"bd3399f7-c8ac-40af-8828-3e7eeb0d2956",1,"INTERFACE (ITcVnImage)"],[3,"fe03c3ef-d5f3-42fc-92be-e49da2a66061",2,"bd3399f7-c8ac-40af-8828-3e7eeb0d2956",2,"ALIAS (HRESULT)"],[4,"bd3399f7-c8ac-40af-8828-3e7eeb0d2956",1,"aebbb247-1956-4d4a-9035-05006d1f42eb",1,"INTERFACE (ITcVnImage)"],[5,"bd3399f7-c8ac-40af-8828-3e7eeb0d2956",1,"89dd1287-b2dd-4672-92a3-10a3d56fdc8e",1,"INTERFACE (ITcVnImage)"],[6,"bd3399f7-c8ac-40af-8828-3e7eeb0d2956",2,"89dd1287-b2dd-4672-92a3-10a3d56fdc8e",2,"ALIAS (HRESULT)"],[7,"9f1c71d4-42bb-47c9-ad0d-46212dd6f65c",1,"74e492bb-b776-4e07-bfdd-25307aa0817d",1,"INTERFACE (ITcVnImage)"],[8,"74e492bb-b776-4e07-bfdd-25307aa0817d",1,"ca41175e-a1e3-41da-b3dd-46a44cd8da92",2,"INTERFACE (ITcVnImage)"],[9,"89dd1287-b2dd-4672-92a3-10a3d56fdc8e",1,"ca41175e-a1e3-41da-b3dd-46a44cd8da92",1,"INTERFACE (ITcVnContainer)"],[10,"89dd1287-b2dd-4672-92a3-10a3d56fdc8e",2,"ca41175e-a1e3-41da-b3dd-46a44cd8da92",4,"ALIAS (HRESULT)"],[11,"de610b61-b6fc-4345-8185-d2cd2798d7d1",1,"ca41175e-a1e3-41da-b3dd-46a44cd8da92",3,"ALIAS (TcVnVector4_LREAL)"],[12,"ca41175e-a1e3-41da-b3dd-46a44cd8da92",1,"d6a6a786-b19f-488b-8315-1d51e4910936",1,"INTERFACE (ITcVnImage)"],[13,"89dd1287-b2dd-4672-92a3-10a3d56fdc8e",1,"efc0545c-fcbd-4762-8f97-b7d8b7433e67",1,"INTERFACE (ITcVnContainer)"],[14,"89dd1287-b2dd-4672-92a3-10a3d56fdc8e",2,"efc0545c-fcbd-4762-8f97-b7d8b7433e67",2,"ALIAS (HRESULT)"],[15,"efc0545c-fcbd-4762-8f97-b7d8b7433e67",1,"d5dc68fa-4d13-4f75-9598-91f1293dfb22",1,"ULINT"],[16,"d5dc68fa-4d13-4f75-9598-91f1293dfb22",2,"e3d9a8cf-442f-45bb-8902-2c7ea7e43213",1,"DINT"],[17,"9e64cb31-6b64-40b9-8418-82e6b2dc56d7",1,"cbecb218-bf3f-4891-bdd5-51f745491222",1,"DINT"],[18,"d5dc68fa-4d13-4f75-9598-91f1293dfb22",2,"cbecb218-bf3f-4891-bdd5-51f745491222",2,"DINT"],[19,"cbecb218-bf3f-4891-bdd5-51f745491222",1,"e29c5364-44c9-4ab2-abca-ceb6ceb3d3af",1,"DINT"]],"groups":[{"id":1,"title":" Load and preprocess","bounding":[56,203.6958770751953,1665.1295166015625,444.0434265136719],"font_size":24,"flags":{},"description":""},{"id":2,"title":"Outer-circle detection and overlay","bounding":[1260.4014892578125,674.5707397460938,910.0687866210938,781.5226440429688],"font_size":24,"flags":{},"description":"F_VN_HoughCirclesExp searches a grayscale image for circular shapes using the Hough transform. Each detected circle is returned with its centre position (X, Y) and radius.\n\nIn this example, it is used to find the outer edge of each doughnut. The allowed radius is limited to 65–90 px, helping to ignore the smaller centre holes. A minimum distance of 120 px between circle centres helps prevent the same doughnut being detected more than once.\n\nThe GRADIENT method is used with a Canny upper threshold of 50 and a circle-centre accumulator threshold of 20. These parameters control how strongly an edge or circle must be detected before it is accepted.\n\nThe detected circles are then drawn in green onto a copy of the original image so the result can be checked visually. For other images, the radius, spacing and detection thresholds may need to be adjusted."},{"id":3,"title":"Calculation and results","bounding":[2188.14453125,674.8111572265625,1110.307861328125,1100.8553466796875],"font_size":24,"flags":{},"description":""}],"config":{},"extra":{"__aiIds":{"9f1c71d4-42bb-47c9-ad0d-46212dd6f65c":"photo","fe03c3ef-d5f3-42fc-92be-e49da2a66061":"gray","bd3399f7-c8ac-40af-8828-3e7eeb0d2956":"smooth","aebbb247-1956-4d4a-9035-05006d1f42eb":"processed","89dd1287-b2dd-4672-92a3-10a3d56fdc8e":"hough","74e492bb-b776-4e07-bfdd-25307aa0817d":"copy","de610b61-b6fc-4345-8185-d2cd2798d7d1":"green","ca41175e-a1e3-41da-b3dd-46a44cd8da92":"draw","d6a6a786-b19f-488b-8315-1d51e4910936":"overlay","efc0545c-fcbd-4762-8f97-b7d8b7433e67":"count","d5dc68fa-4d13-4f75-9598-91f1293dfb22":"signed","e3d9a8cf-442f-45bb-8902-2c7ea7e43213":"countDisplay","9e64cb31-6b64-40b9-8418-82e6b2dc56d7":"dozen","cbecb218-bf3f-4891-bdd5-51f745491222":"x","b016f5c6-f4f9-43ad-b226-f645957ecb5f":"caloriesEach","7d7001df-8659-4748-b775-8ba6bae6ed49":"y","e29c5364-44c9-4ab2-abca-ceb6ceb3d3af":"xDisplay","fe35bc2a-1bbc-48c2-a917-015df4951b97":"yDisplay","c0c552d3-5ba3-4e26-a491-a81191f8bce9":"one","edd91c23-3dfd-4166-a14c-1b2c0ff5ddb1":"gt","1a59c046-aa63-414c-8f1d-46a7d938e45f":"i1","df86d370-91d5-4dcf-9386-165f480a9bbd":"i3","ddbd486f-4af9-4608-8fc3-656886230d9c":"i4","bf2146c6-92fe-44ca-aa0f-ad91e1ae540c":"namePos","08ea2cc8-be92-4708-8a0d-a91bef3165af":"nameLen","61e13c00-8036-45c5-9f10-a2c8937cacc4":"name","8eb75b9d-5850-4af2-a6f3-e2654847e5ac":"xs","befef10e-8e3d-4e96-b8d6-00a83ee5542e":"ys","69c44349-0252-4b23-a92b-c45dc3ceda5f":"s1","3c110d66-7b3c-4c83-b36b-2b9f2be77a4c":"s2","63a52269-9149-4e0c-a193-bb9fe7ab24a7":"s3","8c3baec4-f93a-442c-b71d-5b918375798f":"s4","17289d0a-9ecd-4b01-934f-439ca6c1994a":"s5","0d7c9e44-759d-4872-b9fe-de069c7d76b2":"s6","85a9d471-8997-4c6a-8ba0-80524b5bcc79":"message"},"filemeta":{"name":"Doughnut Detection and Counting with Hough Circles","description":"This example demonstrates how F_VN_HoughCirclesExp can be used to detect and count doughnuts in an image. The image is converted to grayscale and preprocessed to reduce surface texture before detecting the outer circular shape of each doughnut. The detected circles are overlaid on the original image, counted, and compared with the expected quantity to determine how many doughnuts are missing.","tags":["object detection","object counting"]},"annotations_plugin":[],"ds":{"scale":0.6487439570379784,"offset":[874.8411279293687,14.370282983316201]}},"version":0.4,"uuid":"a47ddb77-d1f8-4805-8d79-de0f55655d6d"}